  name: Vilagger
  artwork: {fileID: 0}
  sentences:
  - text: Good to see you again!
    duration: 1.4
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: There is something new you need to know.
    duration: 1.4
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Some beasts will try to attack you. I will teach you how to defend yourself.
    duration: 1.4
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Wait for the first beast to enter the target on the ground.
    duration: 0.3
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: When a beast is attacking you, an exclamation icon will appear next to
      the target.
    duration: 0.9
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Regardless wether the beast is on the ground or the air, press both sides
      of the screen at the same time to defend.
    duration: 0
    waitForInput: 1
  - text: Well done! Now let's try with a gorilla coming from the air.
    duration: 0.7
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Wait for it to enter the target.
    duration: 0.3
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Press both sides of the screen again.
    duration: 0
    waitForInput: 1
  - text: Great job!
    duration: 1.9
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Defeat the incoming gorillas on your own now.
    duration: 10.6
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Nice!
    duration: 1.4
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: Use what you've learned to get through the next wave of beasts.
    duration: 11.9
    waitForInput: 0
  - text: You did it again! You've now learned everything you need to know.
    duration: 1.6
    waitForInput: 0
